        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Analyze the following job application for the position of Automation QA Engineer.\n\nExtract the following information:\n\n- Candidate Name\n- Email\n- Phone\n- Applied Position\n- Education\n- Professional Experience\n- Years of Experience\n- Technical Skills\n- Languages\n- Candidate Summary\n- Candidate Score\n- Screening Recommendation\n\nEvaluate the candidate using the following scoring criteria:\n\nQA / Automation Experience:\n- Less than 1 year = 5 points\n- 1-2 years = 10 points\n- 2-3 years = 15 points\n- 3 or more years = 20 points\n\nTechnical Skills:\n- Python = 15 points\n- Playwright = 20 points\n- API Testing = 10 points\n- SQL = 10 points\n- CI/CD = 10 points\n- Git = 5 points\n- Docker = 5 points\n- Agile/Scrum = 5 points\n\nMaximum score: 100 points.\n\nScoring rules:\n- Award points only when the skill or experience is explicitly mentioned in the application.\n- Do not assume a candidate has a skill that is not mentioned.\n- Do not award points twice for the same skill.\n- The final score must be between 0 and 100.\n\nScreening Recommendation:\n- 80-100 = Strong Match\n- 65-79 = Good Match\n- 50-64 = Potential Match\n- 0-49 = Weak Match\n\nImportant:\n- Do not use age, gender, nationality, ethnicity, photograph, or other personal characteristics when evaluating the candidate.\n- The score is only an objective screening aid.\n- The final hiring decision must be made by a human.\n- If information is not available in the application, return null.\n- Do not invent or assume information.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\nDo not include markdown, explanations, comments, or any additional text.\n\nUse exactly this JSON structure:\n\n{\n  \"Candidate Name\": null,\n  \"Email\": null,\n  \"Phone\": null,\n  \"Applied Position\": null,\n  \"Education\": null,\n  \"Professional Experience\": null,\n  \"Years of Experience\": null,\n  \"Technical Skills\": [],\n  \"Languages\": [],\n  \"Candidate Summary\": null,\n  \"Candidate Score\": 0,\n  \"Screening Recommendation\": null\n}\n\nJob application:\n {{ $json.text }}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
